0..74 Comment "// Factorial by recursion and by iteration agree, and a factorial is even."
75..77 Comment "//"
78..154 Comment "// Grégoire and Leroy time factorial on unary naturals, its parity, and two"
155..231 Comment "// factorial terms with one normal form. The parity reads back one constant,"
232..259 Comment "// so the run dominates it."
260..262 Comment "//"
263..343 Comment "// One path compares the recursive and the iterative factorial of six. The other"
344..389 Comment "// states that the factorial of five is even."
390..392 Comment "//"
393..472 Comment "// - see: Grégoire and Leroy, _A compiled implementation of strong reduction_,"
473..493 Comment "//   ICFP 2002, § 6"
494..531 Comment "// - see: #2282 — the benchmark set"
533..554 Comment "// The free naturals."
